//   - library contributions: PUBLISHED entries stay in the library under their licence with the contributor id cleared
//     (the takedown/ownership rule: the owner can still take one down; projects and mods that use it keep working from
//     their own copy, lib/cyrus/library/backend/moderation.ts). Contributions not yet published are removed.
//   - server grants: revoked on the platform side
//   - export archives of the person: removed from disk
